msgid "Use Basic Joint Controller"
msgstr "使用 Basic Joint Controller"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:3
#: 5ffaed99585f4dafaa3e24c3df88e1a5
msgid ""
"Run the joint-position controller (HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ) — **Basic Joint "
"Controller** (`basic_joint_controller`) — from "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control)."
msgstr ""
"从 [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) "
"运行关节位置控制器（HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ）— **Basic Joint "
"Controller**（`basic_joint_controller`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:5
#: 1998df4e3f984a338f5b53ed587e0fc9
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:8
#: 43ca037396d548dabacdc791581bc147
msgid ""
"Steps and topics below are from "
"[basic_joint_controller/README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README.md)"
" (and [README_zh.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README_zh.md))."
msgstr ""
"下列步骤和话题摘自 [basic_joint_controller/README.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README.md)（及"
" [README_zh.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/basic_joint_controller/README_zh.md)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:10
#: fdf9c63f17ae4c12b783e831d188532d
msgid "`/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`**, not `String`."
msgstr "`/fsm_command` 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**，不是 `String`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:13
#: 728b1f5492864535a5c9579d83820db5
msgid ""
"On the public `open-deploy-ws` **`arx-lift2s`** branch, "
"`basic_joint_controller` is in the README’s `colcon build --packages-up-"
"to` list (simulation and real-hardware). Lift2S **split body** / **full "
"body** are chosen in `./quick_start.sh` — see [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) and [分体控制 vs "
"全身控制](../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)."
msgstr ""
"在公开的 `open-deploy-ws` **`arx-lift2s`** 分支上，`basic_joint_controller` 出现在 "
"README 的 `colcon build --packages-up-to` 列表中（仿真与真机）。Lift2S 的 **分体** / "
"**全身** 在 `./quick_start.sh` 中选择 — 见 [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) 和 [分体控制 vs "
"全身控制](../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)。"

