msgstr "本控制器独立运行时为 MOVEJ；在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上 `3` 表示 **OCS2**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:56
#: 6a459d2338c3415e9873225b53b5f7dd
msgid ""
"MOVEJ returns only to HOLD (`2`). Full table and home-config `100`+ "
"commands: [Basic Joint "
"Controller](../../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"MOVEJ 只能回到 HOLD（`2`）。完整表与 Home 构型 `100`+ 命令见 [Basic Joint "
"Controller](../../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:58
